msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introducción"

msgid "Android plugin"
msgstr "Plugin de Android"

msgid ""
"Building on the previous v1 architecture, Android plugins continue to be "
"derived from the `Android archive library <https://developer.android.com/"
"studio/projects/android-library#aar-contents>`_."
msgstr ""
"Compilar en la arquitectura previa v1, plugins de Android continúan siendo "
"derivados de la `bliblioteca de archivos Android <https://"
"developer.android.com/studio/projects/android-library#aar-contents>`_."

msgid "Android libraries"
msgstr "Bibliotecas de Android"

msgid "Kotlin and Java libraries"
msgstr "Bibliotecas de Kotlin y Java"

msgid "GDExtension libraries"
msgstr "Librerías de GDExtension"

msgid ""
"Each plugin has an init class extending from the `GodotPlugin <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0a7f75ec7b465604b6496c8f5f1d638aed250d6d/"
"platform/android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/plugin/"
"GodotPlugin.java#L80>`_ class which is provided by the :ref:`Godot Android "
"library <doc_android_library>`."
msgstr ""
"Cada plugin tiene una clase de inicialización que hereda de la clase "
"`GodotPlugin <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"0a7f75ec7b465604b6496c8f5f1d638aed250d6d/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/"
"godotengine/godot/plugin/GodotPlugin.java#L80>`_, proporcionada por "
"la :ref:`librería de Android de Godot <doc_android_library>`."

msgid "Where:"
msgstr "Dónde:"

msgid "``PluginName`` is the name of the plugin"
msgstr "``PluginName`` es el nombre del plugin"

msgid "Packaging a v2 Android plugin"
msgstr "Empacar un plugin v2 de Android"

msgid ""
"Add the plugin output binaries within the plugin directory (e.g: in ``addons/"
"<plugin_name>/``)"
msgstr ""
"Añade los archivos binarios de salida del plugin dentro del directorio del "
"plugin (por ejemplo, en ``addons/<plugin_name>/``)"

msgid ""
"Add the `tool script <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/"
"plugins/editor/making_plugins.html#the-script-file>`_ for the export "
"functionality within the plugin directory (e.g: in ``addons/<plugin_name>/``)"
msgstr ""
"Añade el `script de herramienta <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/"
"tutorials/plugins/editor/making_plugins.html#the-script-file>`_ para la "
"funcionalidad de exportación dentro del directorio del plugin (por ejemplo, "
"en ``addons/<plugin_name>/``)"

msgid ""
"`_get_android_dependencies <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/"
"class_editorexportplugin.html#class-editorexportplugin-method-get-android-"
"dependencies>`_:"
msgstr ""
"`_get_android_dependencies <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/"
"class_editorexportplugin.html#class-editorexportplugin-method-get-android-"
"dependencies>`_:"

msgid ""
"For reference, here is the `folder structure for the Godot Android plugin "
"project template <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Plugin-Template/"
"tree/main/plugin/export_scripts_template>`_. At build time, the contents of "
"the ``export_scripts_template`` directory as well as the generated plugin "
"binaries are copied to the ``addons/<plugin_name>`` directory:"
msgstr ""
"Como referencia, aquí tienes la `estructura de carpetas de la plantilla del "
"proyecto del plugin de Android para Godot <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-"
"Android-Plugin-Template/tree/main/plugin/export_scripts_template>`_. Durante "
"la compilación, el contenido del directorio ``export_scripts_template``, así "
"como los archivos binarios del plugin generados, se copian al directorio "
"``addons/<plugin_name>``:"

msgid ""
"For reference, here is the `folder structure for the GDExtension Android "
"plugin project template <https://github.com/m4gr3d/GDExtension-Android-"
"Plugin-Template/tree/main/plugin/export_scripts_template>`_. At build time, "
"the contents of the ``export_scripts_template`` directory as well as the "
"generated plugin binaries are copied to the ``addons/<plugin_name>`` "
"directory:"
msgstr ""
"Como referencia, aquí tienes la `estructura de carpetas de la plantilla del "
"proyecto del plugin de Android para GDExtension <https://github.com/m4gr3d/"
"GDExtension-Android-Plugin-Template/tree/main/plugin/"
"export_scripts_template>`_. Durante la compilación, el contenido del "
"directorio ``export_scripts_template``, así como los archivos binarios del "
"plugin generados, se copian al directorio ``addons/<plugin_name>``:"

msgid "Using a v2 Android plugin"
msgstr "Usar un plugin v2 de Android"

msgid ""
"Copy the plugin's output directory (``addons/<plugin_name>``) to the target "
"Godot project's directory"
msgstr ""
"Copia el directorio de salida del plugin (``addons/<plugin_name>``) al "
"directorio del proyecto de Godot de destino"

msgid ""
"Navigate to ``Project`` -> ``Project Settings...`` -> ``Plugins``, and "
"ensure the plugin is enabled"
msgstr ""
"Dirígete a ``Projecto`` -> ``Ajustes del Proyecto...`` -> ``Plugins``, y "
"asegúrate de que el plugin esté habilitado"

msgid "Reference implementations"
msgstr "Implementaciones de referenca"

msgid ""
"`Godot Android Plugins Samples <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-"
"Samples/tree/master/plugins>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Ejemplos de plugins de Android para Godot <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-"
"Android-Samples/tree/master/plugins>`_"

msgid ""
"`Godot Android Plugin Template <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-"
